//
// DO NOT EDIT MANUALLY. This file is generated by
// libc/utils/iconv_utils/gen.py from the mapping files it lists.
//
// A _HIGH table gives the code points of bytes 0x80 to 0xFF, for a set which
// agrees with ASCII below them; a _FULL table gives all 256. 0xFFFD marks a
// byte the set does not assign.
//
// For a set which joins a character and the combining mark after it, a
// _COMPOSITIONS table gives the pairs it joins and what they make, in the
// order of the pair, and a _DECOMPOSITIONS table gives the bytes it writes a
// character it has no byte for as, in the order of the character.
//
//===----------------------------------------------------------------------===//

